<title>HONG KONG: SBC Warburg names HK property research directors.</title>
<headline>SBC Warburg names HK property research directors.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBC Warburg said on Friday it has appointed Franklin Lam as director of property research and George Kee as associate director.</p>
<p>Both Franklin and Kee joined the investment bank from HG Asia, SBC Warburg said in a statement.</p>
<p>SBC Warburg is a division of Swiss Bank Corp.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
